false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10109735", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974911541", "personaname": "Grady", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197974911541/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 592, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 483, "last_played": 1435261931, "avatar": "63a635a02683daa23639f303180b426f090c6c96"}, "language": "english", "review": "Repetitive combat and what I considered to be a very boring story.  The most fun I had in this was from the jet pack that you get randomly throughout the game.  However, they are short lived intervals and then it's back to the grind.  This is comparable to Gears of War with more melee combat, but is much less interesting and the environments are bland.", "timestamp_created": 1400072665, "timestamp_updated": 1400072665, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.499989062547683716", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10105295", "author": {"steamid": "76561197998836042", "personaname": "TonyShoes", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197998836042/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 1758, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1526, "last_played": 1414284886, "avatar": "f05078aef280b9317cafb9c8c69accaf68b28da3"}, "language": "english", "review": "This was a great game. Cannot understand why they dropped it... or at least try to add some new game content (not items). There are very few games I'd bother replaying, or even finishing... but this was a real gem. The multiplayer was good too!!!", "timestamp_created": 1400022331, "timestamp_updated": 1400022331, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.475113123655319214", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10097975", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017573076", "personaname": "Kaldor Draigo", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Imperial_Zealot/", "num_games_owned": 271, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 2773, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1138, "last_played": 1535755597, "avatar": "3874978b9391219e66fd487532c843ec89a8ceab"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game takes place in a setting where you, an Ultramarine known as Captain Titus lead two other men to defend the world from the Chaos and Orks; that's it. There are 16 chapters of this game where you will literally run around, shoot, or beat up people up using your close combat weapon while trying to complete the objective. Overall, the story of this game is bland and the characters are duller than the countours of a sphere, they literally have no character. So far, the game's strongest point is its combat which is extremely fun. You'll have a blast ripping through orks with a power axe or slamming down the emperor's justice upon them using the Thunder hammer, along with destroying large enemies with the Meltagun.\n\nSo if superhumans wearing unrealisticly heavy armor beating up Orks and Daemons with a variety of weapons is your type of game, give this game a go.\n\nOh and nobody plays multiplayer, so hold your breath if you think you're going to play coop mode with anyone else, or have a fair chance of being a balanced match with players your level.", "timestamp_created": 1399951117, "timestamp_updated": 1399951117, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}